# Rebuild API container after code changes

After any change that affects the running API (src, prisma, docker, config, package.json), rebuild and recreate the API container. Do not wait for the user to ask.

```bash
cd docker && docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d --build --force-recreate api
```

Then wait until both health checks return 200:

- `GET http://localhost:8030/api/v1/health/live`
- `GET http://localhost:8030/api/v1/health/ready`

Skip rebuild only for docs, comments, or frontend-only edits in a sibling repo.
